WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450
Welcome to our training on the Manage Your Compliance Dashboard.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:10.350
In this module, you'll learn how to view and respond to product compliance requests and how to submit

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.500
the required documentation.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.567
You'll also learn how to appeal compliance requests.

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:21.083
It's important that products in the Amazon Store are safe for customers to use and that listings

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:23.000
are fair for all sellers.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.783
Everyone who shops and sells in the Amazon Store must be able to trust that the products are held

00:00:28.783 --> 00:00:30.000
to the highest standards.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.690
It's also important that sellers can file and organize all the necessary information and documentation

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:41.000
to show that their products comply with Amazon's policies and government standards and regulations.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.346
The Manage Your Compliance Dashboard is designed to make this process easier by allowing you to

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:52.000
organize, submit and track your compliance documentation in one central place.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.069
To reach the Manage Your Compliance Dashboard, open the top menu by selecting the button with three

00:00:58.069 --> 00:01:03.000
horizontal lines in the top left corner of the Seller Central home page.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Under Performance, select Account Health.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.200
Once you're on the Account Health Dashboard, scroll to the bottom of the page to find a Manage Your

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.000
Compliance card.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.913
From here, you can navigate to the Manage Your Compliance Dashboard.

00:01:16.913 --> 00:01:22.000
This dashboard will show you at a glance any products that require documentation.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.111
The dashboard shows not only each product's name but also their Amazon Standard Identification Numbers

00:01:28.111 --> 00:01:33.000
or ASINs as well as their Stock Keeping Unit Numbers or SKUs.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:40.200
You can see the specific documents or information that are required and the date by which they must

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.000
be provided.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.000
You can also see the approval status for any documentation or information you've submitted.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.800
You may be required to provide compliance documents or information if you intend to sell a product

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.000
that's subject to restrictions in your region's store.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.000
The specific class of documents or information you need to upload is displayed on the dashboard.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:08.000
To submit them, select the Add Appeal Compliance button to go to the Add Compliance page.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.107
For each category of document that's been requested, you can drag and drop a file to upload or browse

00:02:14.107 --> 00:02:17.000
your hard drive to find and select a file.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:23.333
If you need more information about a request, hover over the question mark next to the name of the

00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:24.000
request type.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.750
Remember that files must be less than 25 megabytes and can only be submitted in a supported format

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.000
as indicated on the submission page.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.000
If the files you submitted aren't supported, you'll get an error and will need to upload a new file.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:45.857
If you feel that you need to explain any of your documents further, you can provide that information

00:02:45.857 --> 00:02:47.000
in additional comments.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.000
If you believe the request was made in error, you can appeal.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:56.000
To do so, select Appeal Request above the area for submitting documents.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:03.000
When you appeal, you must provide a reason, select the Appeal Reason from the drop-down list.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.000
Again, you can explain your reason for the appeal in more detail in the additional comments field.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.000
Once you've provided the documents you need, select Submit.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:19.947
You can see the status of any of your compliance submissions or appeal requests from the Manage

00:03:19.947 --> 00:03:21.000
Your Compliance dashboard.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:25.000
If you select any item, you'll see an overview of the current status.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.000
Remember that customer safety is everyone's responsibility.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:34.000
By working together to document your product's compliance with policies and regulations,

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:40.545
we can help customers trust that products they purchase in the Amazon store are of the highest quality

00:03:40.545 --> 00:03:42.000
and safe to use.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.720
While different types of products may have different requirements, the Manage Your Compliance dashboard

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:53.000
will help you organize and monitor all compliance requests for your offers.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:58.217
Whenever you need to check this dashboard, select Account Health under the Performance menu and

00:03:58.217 --> 00:04:01.000
then select the card for Manage Your Compliance.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:06.500
And if you need information about specific product types, check the Product Compliance Documentation

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:12.000
Help page on Seller Central for information about the types of documentation we request.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:18.250
To watch this video again, search for Manage Your Compliance Dashboard on Seller University or bookmark

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:22.000
the page you're on right now for future reference.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.000
This concludes our training on the Manage Your Compliance dashboard.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:30.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
